WEBVTT

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:14.050
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.280
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.690
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.730
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.670
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:38.920
Y-Yes, l see.
I'll make preparations immediately.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:40.820
lt's an urgent mission.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:41.660
What's that?

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.430
Might it by chance be about the youth we studied before?

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.490
Yes, it hasn't yet been confirmed,

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:48.040
but he seems to have been disposed of.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.730
ls that so?
A pity, he was still so young.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.330
We are to recover the black kakugane embedded in his chest.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.300
<i>Kazuki's been...!?</i>

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:57.470
The site is lruka Beach in Chiba Prefecture.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.110
lt's possible he'll be discovered as a drowning victim.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.870
We need to check the info at the site.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:03.540
The locaI hospital needs to be apprised of the situation.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:19.720
Let go!

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.530
There's no way Captain Bravo would leave a mission unaccomplished...!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.450
This is the Energy Drain...

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:38.650
lt can't be!

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.120
Even if he were unconscious and not breathing...

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:41.660
with the black kakugane,

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.320
he cannot die just from being physically killed.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.090
ln that case, Kazuki must still be...

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:50.800
Tokiko!

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:55.970
<i>When Dawn Comes</i>

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:02.000
Kazuki, Kazuki, wake up! Kazuki!

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.980
lt's no use, Tokiko.
He's a monster.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.810
lf you don't exterminate him now,

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.480
irreparable harm may be done!

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:12.080
—Buso...!
—Stop!

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.680
l am responsible for making
Kazuki like this!

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:19.490
lf you want to call Kazuki a monster, then call me one, too!

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.090
Crap!

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:29.700
Gota?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.410
Drain me, not Tokiko!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.040
As the Alchemist Army predicted,

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:44.420
the Energy Drain has no effect upon the Silver Skin.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:49.280
And in Reverse, the drain itself can barely be shut out.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.460
ls that so?
That is most unfortunate.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:55.990
So this means that you hold the trump card

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:57.460
in the battle against Victor?

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:02.000
l'm a bit jealous!

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:03.900
You're being hasty.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.230
This is just the the result against a hypothetical enemy.

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.640
lt won't necessarily have the same effect against Victor.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.400
That hypothetical enemy,
Kazuki Muto, was it?

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.720
Why did you leave him in the ocean?

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:16.420
lt can't be...

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.680
Don't tell me that you did that to let him get away?

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.720
Don't underestimate me, Hiwatari!

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.520
l felt his death with this very fist.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.190
There is no doubt that l killed Kazuki Muto.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.100
l shall lead the unit to recover the kakugane.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.970
You shouldn't make any unnecessary moves, Sakimori.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.830
Don't call me by that name.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.400
You've received orders to return to base, haven't you?

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.910
Return to Army headquarters and await the report.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.580
How did you find this place?

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:57.520
l was in charge of the computer network

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:01.960
at Doctor Butterfly's LXE secret base.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.790
lf l remember correctly,

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.990
didn't the Alchemist Army take you into protection?

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.870
Have you come to defeat me in order to earn some points with them?

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.710
My kakugane has been confiscated.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:17.810
l have come here for Kazuki's sake.

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:23.110
l have come to get your help, Papillon.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.550
Well, then...

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.190
Shall l hear what you have to say?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:39.230
Oh, no.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.430
l must've passed out. How long...?

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.910
Kazuki!

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.070
l'm sorry!

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:51.080
Dying and coming back to life.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:52.840
Coming back to life only to die again.

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:54.480
l'm always causing you trouble.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:57.880
But, there won't be a next time.

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:00.590
Kazuki!

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:06.290
l've hacked into the Army computers.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:09.820
Kazuki Muto's condition is now at Stage One.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.200
ln six weeks, he will make the transition to Stage Two.

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:17.200
He is expected to transform into a being identical to the first Victor.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.300
Kazuki Muto is being called Victor III.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.940
He is to be dispatched swiftly and in secrecy

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.540
to recover the black kakugane.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:27.640
What a dreadful state of affairs...

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:29.810
We've no time to stand about.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:33.590
lf we let matters stand,
Kazuki will surely be killed.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:38.360
You would like to kill
Kazuki yourself, wouldn't you?

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:40.390
What are you getting at?

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.130
Help Kazuki.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:46.030
l'm serious about this!

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.460
You, yourself, are scheming to become like Victor, aren't you?

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.400
Wouldn't it be good to have a sample close at hand?

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:55.400
But, of course!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.240
Saving Muto from the Alchemist Army is not a bad proposition

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:00.410
from your point of view either.

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:01.650
That's right!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.110
But the answer is no!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.620
You see, l love to use other people,

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:09.120
but l hate to be used by them.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:13.690
And l don't like the way that you are trying to manipulate me,

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.700
while you yourself are not taking any action.

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:18.770
l would do something if l could!

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.390
But at present l have no kakugane.

00:06:21.470 --> 00:06:23.560
Even if l could take action, l lack the strength!

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:32.310
Kakugane Serial Number 70, the one that Doctor Butterfly was using.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:34.820
You say you have no power?

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:38.040
What about your ability to elicit information from the Army?

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.380
What about your designs on using me?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.990
lnfiltrate the Army and use your strength!

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.780
YOU take action for ME!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:49.130
Oh my. lt looks like l have been used.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:50.660
Buso Renkin!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.560
Angel Gozen, is back as an Alternate Type!

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.840
But, l seem to have taken some strange form.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:06:59.840
Oh, my.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.640
Hmm. Rather stylish!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:05.540
The location is at lruka Beach, was it?

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:10.440
l intend to struggle on as a human being,

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:12.540
for the next six weeks.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:16.880
l see. But that's a stance and not action.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:20.620
You speak of action, but what would you have me do...?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.830
The black kakugane embedded in your chest,

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:26.590
l recovered it from a previous mission.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:28.940
That's right, you told me before.

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.030
That you came to Ginsei City

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.570
after completing a previous mission infiltrating a school.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:37.040
lf we return to the school and investigate,

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:40.380
we might find a method of dealing with the black kakugane.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.380
Got it!
I'll head there immediately!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.550
l can't let you go alone, Kazuki. l'm going with you.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:47.220
You mustn't!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.220
lf you go with me, you will be regarded as a traitor.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.650
l don't care. l'm not leaving your side...

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:53.820
Tokiko!

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:57.560
l know what you're thinking.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:00.970
lf six weeks pass and it was all in vain,

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:04.340
you were going to finish off yourself, weren't you?

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.510
l can't let that happen.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:07.840
For the next six weeks,

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:09.310
you and l shall be as one mind and body.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.810
The time when you die, is also the time when l die.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:18.840
Do you understand?!

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:22.820
l will not die.
And, l won't let you die either, Tokiko.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.590
Kazuki, what's wrong with your right hand?

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:27.180
Eh?

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:28.860
You're wounded, aren't you?

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:31.820
Thank you.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:33.930
l just remembered about Gota.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.490
Gota!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.360
Gota!

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:05.960
<i>What are you laughing about?</i>
<i>On your feet, Gota.</i>

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:09.590
<i>lf you can't pass</i> <i>this survival training,</i>

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.160
<i>you'll never make it</i> <i>as a Warrior!</i>

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:15.040
<i>l've had it, Tokiko.</i> <i>l'm too tired to go on.</i>

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:16.370
<i>On your feet!</i>

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:19.650
<i>lf you don't get up, l won't be able</i> <i>to tend to your injuries...</i>

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.440
<i>So why were you brought</i> <i>into the Army?</i>

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:27.580
<i>l am told that my family was slaughtered</i> <i>by the homunculi.</i>

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:28.640
<i>You were told?</i>

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:31.690
<i>l don't remember a thing.</i>

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:33.690
<i>l was just a baby at the time,</i>

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.420
<i>so l remember neither</i> <i>the homunculi nor my family...</i>

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.270
<i>As far back as l can remember,</i>

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:41.860
<i>l was in an institution run</i> <i>by the Alchemist Army.</i>

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.470
<i>l was deemed to possess</i> <i>the requisite qualities of a Warrior,</i>

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.600
<i>so here l am...</i>

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:51.610
<i>l've had it. Forget about it.</i>

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:53.180
<i>ls that so?</i>

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.140
<i>But...</i>

00:09:55.920 --> 00:10:00.150
<i>Even you may someday have</i> <i>something worth fighting for...</i>

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:07.930
<i>Someday, there may be something</i> <i>you must protect at all costs.</i>

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:11.260
<i>Why not get stronger now</i>

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:14.430
<i>so that you will not be powerless</i> <i>when such a time comes!</i>

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.160
<i>Now, get up, Gota...</i>

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.240
l can't get up, Tokiko...

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.110
Get up, you!

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.550
Warrior Chief Hiwatari?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:36.190
Your mission was to detain the female warrior Tokiko.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.280
What has become of her?

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.220
Where is the woman?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:44.230
Don't tell me that she's with Kazuki Muto now?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.000
So he is still alive?

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:50.700
Right! Then, lead me to him.

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:53.370
l shall exterminate Kazuki Muto, otherwise known as Victor III!

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:57.100
Him, and the traitor,Tokiko.

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.540
W-Wait a minute, please.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.640
She hasn't been judged to be a traitor yet...

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.660
You told her how dangerous
Victor III is, didn't you?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.290
lf she persists in protecting him, then she is a traitor.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.520
So, you guys finally show up...

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.070
What took you so long?!

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.140
lkusabe, Negoro, reporting for duty!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.830
lt's time to mobilize the Re-Extermination Squad.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.900
Your mission is the extermination of Victor III.

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:29.440
And there is a traitor who has allied herself with him.

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:32.170
Depending upon the circumstances, you may need to dispose of her as well.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.310
But, they're both still children.

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:36.280
lt may sound extreme, but it can't be helped.

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:38.610
Though he is incomplete, that one is still like Victor.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:42.120
<i>Someday, there may be something</i> <i>you want to protect at all costs...</i>

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:46.730
<i>...so that you will not be powerless</i> <i>when such a time comes!</i>

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:48.460
What's the matter?

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:49.930
Hurry up and show me where they are.

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:52.200
l refuse!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.160
What?!

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:55.830
No way is it possible for me to kill Tokiko

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.130
under any circumstances!

00:11:57.640 --> 00:11:58.900
Absolutely impossible!

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.630
Have you gone mad?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.170
What do you think you're doing?

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:08.110
Have you gone mad? lt's three against one!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.320
You may never have seen real battle, but even ignorance has its limits, rookie!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:13.320
So you're refusing a challenge from a rookie.

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:16.080
ls that the way you veterans fight?

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.290
Outspoken, aren't you!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.060
Buso Renkin!

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:24.930
Empty handed?!

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:35.130
Remote demolition?
Or rather, teleportation?

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:38.910
No, that's not it, either.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.180
We were hit by something small launched at high speed,

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:43.980
outside our visual field...

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.320
Buso Renkin of Chakram!

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:52.420
Motor Gear!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:53.620
Chakram?

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:55.160
lt's an lndian form of thrown weapon!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.230
He really thought it through, didn't he?

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.060
Destroy our means for transportation and at the same time,

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.100
create a smokescreen with the explosion.

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:04.360
And then, amidst the commotion, people would immediately rush out.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:07.430
An unexpected development following a surprise attack.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.840
This time, a quick draw from a new angle?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.370
Bring it on!

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:15.010
<i>That is Warrior Chief Hiwatari's</i>
<i>Buso Renkin!</i>

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:24.710
Seems like he plans to flee, using the Chakram as a decoy?

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:27.620
Warrior Chief, there's a fire engine five kilometers up ahead.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:29.390
lt will be here in about ten minutes...

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:32.760
Go!

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:38.400
Just as l expected...

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:40.670
But he won't be able to get away just like that.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.450
Motor gear! Skywalker Mode!

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:49.750
lf l defeat this guy, l will be able to protect Tokiko...

00:13:58.760 --> 00:13:59.450
Did it!

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:01.720
You did? Think again!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.710
Below lies the ocean?!

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.270
Are you all right?

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:19.400
What happened to that little rascal?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:20.670
He fled.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:26.520
Warrior Chief!

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.790
Withdraw! Leave no trace!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.290
<i>Even mortal injuries are not fatal.</i>

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:42.960
<i>What on earth</i> <i>can his Buso Renkin be,</i>

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.440
<i>and what are its characteristics?</i>

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.810
<i>Tokiko!</i>

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:55.410
Stretch, contract, stretch, contract.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:58.650
Stretch, stretch, stretch even more!

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:03.950
Believe it or not... l am a master at inducing hypnosis!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:05.220
Well, then, next...

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:06.950
Twist, twist.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.120
Twist, twist.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:14.600
Good morning.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.500
What are you doing, this early in the morning?

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.100
Kazuki! This is your doing, isn't it?!

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.500
No, you're wrong! lt was all Rokumasu's doing!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:24.280
Stop acting foolish and be quiet. lt's early in the morning...

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.240
Where is my luggage?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.120
Too bad, you missed!

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:36.550
Pretending to be...

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.780
sound asleep...

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:40.450
Where did you slip out to in the middle of the night?

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.500
Were you making out?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.320
That's a no-no.
You should be punished!

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.460
Be quiet, l tell you!
You're bothering the other guests!

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:48.900
Shush!

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:52.430
ls it, by any chance, a mission?

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:53.970
Well, you might say.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.570
ln that case, l guess we shouldn't ask for the details.

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:58.270
We'd appreciate that...

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:01.910
This time, it might take a maximum of six weeks...

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:05.180
Six weeks? So, it'll be the new semester when we meet again?

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:07.190
You're giving up your summer vacation for work?

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.120
Gee, it's tough being a defender of justice.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:11.250
Anyway, don't make extra work for Tokiko...

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.460
Both of you, watch yourselves.

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:14.920
Do your best, you two!

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:18.630
Here, you go —an umbrella.
There's only one, but use it.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.060
Off with you, and return safely.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.940
See you next semester.

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:23.130
Ahh...

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.130
See you.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.580
They were both injured, weren't they?

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:29.610
Yes, that's right.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.210
l wonder if it was okay to send them off like that,

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:33.580
pretending not to notice...

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.380
lt's better that way, l tell you.

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:36.810
Will you be all right?

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:39.080
I'll be fine! Don't worry!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.330
Let's go, Kazuki.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.960
Off we go, and we're coming back for sure!

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:57.800
For sure!

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:04.140
The fire spread to two cars and one abandoned house,

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.410
but there were no human casualties.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:08.610
We must make sure there are no civilian fatalities.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.450
How long can we protect them though?

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.040
Well...

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.380
Follow that rookie.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.960
He is sure to meet up with the traitors...

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:20.530
With further training, he would probably become a fine Warrior...

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.020
Like hell he will!
He, too, will be disposed of!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.490
Warrior Chief!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.100
Use the unreasonable to force the unreasonable into submission.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.760
That is my way of doing things!

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.810
lnform the Army that Sakimori has failed...

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.210
Tell them that l shall proceed with the Re-Extermination.

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:42.010
This is where l fought Bravo last night.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.610
l never would have dreamed that such a thing would happen.

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:50.550
The comrades that l fight with are you,
Tokiko, and Bravo,

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.420
so l would have liked to carry out the next mission together.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.500
We've lost a member.

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:57.390
Yeah...

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.770
l don't think there will ever be another time

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.270
with the three of us fighting side by side.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:05.530
Gota!

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:07.100
Tokiko?!

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:11.940
The Re-Extermination Squad and Warrior Chief Hiwatari?

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:16.110
Gota, you should return to the Alchemist Army.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:18.640
You will not be able to avoid disciplinary action,

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:20.520
but you'll live.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.620
No! l'm coming along with you.
We must go into hiding.

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:29.250
<i>Tokiko, you have also become</i> <i>a target of the Re-Extermination Unit.</i>

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.320
l'm going with you.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.000
l heard all about it from Tokiko.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.360
Thank you for last night.

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:40.640
—Ouch!
—Ouch!

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:41.470
Watch what you're doing!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:44.070
Let me see.
I'll tend to your injuries.

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:47.810
Eh? lt's okay. l took care of it myself.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:48.910
Nevertheless, let me see.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:52.550
l overdid it last night. Sorry...

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:58.280
We both hurt our right hands, didn't we?

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.950
Well, then. Once again.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.520
Watch what you're doing!

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:06.800
Good grief!

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.860
You make me anxious about the future, at this rate.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.230
l'm going to withdraw some money from the ATM

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:13.360
before our accounts are frozen.
Wait here...

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.980
l just want to make it clear that l'm not doing this for you!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.340
l don't care what happens to you after we flee.

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.610
l don't even care what happens to myself.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.710
l just want to protect Tokiko.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.720
l'm beginning to feel that

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:30.760
l might be able to get along with you, after all.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.650
We really should shake on it.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:34.850
Out of the question!

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:36.690
Okay, l was still able to make a withdrawal.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:38.930
With this, we won't have to worry about funds for a while.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.730
lf your bandage gets too wet, your wound will trouble you.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.040
Excuse me.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:46.670
Okay, let's go.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.170
Gota, don't push!

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.580
Shall l buy an umbrella at the convenience store?

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:52.840
No, we're fine like this!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:55.910
Mu!

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.980
Receiving telepathic message from Undercover Operative Ouka!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.420
What is it? What? What?!

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:03.250
Be happy, Pappy. "Kazuki" is still alive.

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:06.480
Just as l thought.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.500
What? What's wrong?

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:12.960
l just felt a monstrous chill!

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:16.260
What happened?
Angel Gozen? Angel Gozen?

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:19.570
No need to fret because arrival was delayed.

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.370
After all, we've come all the way to the beach.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.770
Shall l go for a dip in my super awesome swimsuit?

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:29.240
The Alchemist Army may know more about the black kakugane,

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:32.380
but when it comes to Muto, l know far more...

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.920
That one will not kick the bucket so easily...

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.760
l estimate 41 days.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:42.060
That is how long Kazuki Muto can remain a human being.

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:47.270
The place where l found that kakugane...

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:49.140
l'm sure if we go there we will learn something!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.110
l will cure Kazuki!

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:53.320
And l will defeat anyone who stands in our way,

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:54.750
no matter who they are!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.780
Next time, "The Escape."

00:20:57.220 --> 00:20:59.050
I'll splatter your guts out!

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:06.890
Mahiro Muto's Buso Renkin Seminar!

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:10.300
Hello, this is Mahiro Muto!

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.860
For this seminar
I'll be a bit serious

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:15.170
as we introduce today's
Buso Renkin.

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:18.170
Even l do something seriously once in a while!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:21.200
Oh, no, no, no, l mean l always do it seriously!

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:23.540
Now then, for our sixth seminar

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:27.110
let me introduce Victor's Buso Renkin, the "Fatal Attraction"!

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.490
Victor, the former Alchemist Warrior awakened from his long slumber

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:33.960
thanks to the hands of Dr. Butterfly.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:36.290
l don't really know the details,

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:39.490
but Victor who has a black kakugane embedded within his chest,

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.530
is supposed to be a "Third Entity"

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:44.430
that surpasses both homunculi and humans.

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.100
The black kakugane is something

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:50.300
that the Alchemist Army came up with a hundred years ago

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.100
in an attempt to create the "Philosopher's Stone."

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:56.240
lt's a very scary thingie that causes the user's power

00:21:56.310 --> 00:21:59.110
to go out of control and bring destruction!

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:00.550
On top of that,

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:04.580
it brings death to all living beings by sucking away its life force!

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:09.850
That time when the homunculi attacked
Ginsei High and Victor awakened,

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:12.690
all of us felt our strength leaving us.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:14.890
l thought we were done for,

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:19.560
but that was all because of Victor's Energy Drain!

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:25.830
Victor's Buso Renkin that is activated from the black kakugane is a great axe!

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:31.240
Simply put, the giant axe emits a power called "Fatal Attraction,"

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:34.680
but what's amazing is that it can control gravity!

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:38.480
Whatever attack it takes will be cancelled out

00:22:38.550 --> 00:22:41.110
by shifting the gravitational power and direction.

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:45.960
And it will destroy things by twisting and warping it...

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:50.260
Everything gets squashed!
H-How scary!

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:54.530
Although everyone believes
Victor to be a completely evil villain,

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:58.510
it seems he has a very tragic past as well.

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:02.170
l really hope my big brother can resolve everything soon

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:04.810
so everyone can live happily!

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:07.770
Okie dokie, see you next time!

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:16.190
Mahiro Illustration by Taeko Hori
